- [ ] Add `calculateTaskImpact()` async helper to `correlation.ts`
- [ ] Replace `Math.random()` with `await Promise.all(...)` block
- [ ] Update `RecentTask` interface in `dashboard/page.tsx` (`impact: number | null`)
