## Core Technologies

### 1. Next.js 15 (Frontend)

**Why Next.js?**
- Server-Side Rendering (SSR) for data-heavy dashboards
- App Router for modern routing
- Server Components reduce client JS bundle
- Built-in API routes (not used - we use Hono instead)

**Configuration:**

```javascript
// next.config.js
