   const previewOrigins = (process.env.FRONTEND_URL_PREVIEW ?? '').split(',').map(s => s.trim()).filter(Boolean)
   const origins = ['http://localhost:3002', process.env.FRONTEND_URL, ...previewOrigins].filter(Boolean) as string[]
   ```
